    {
      "id": "gMORgfYzwCwwAtaFuYPOF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 718.3672334577352,
      "y": 1317.321931767985,
      "width": 898.25927734375,
      "height": 1450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b23",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 772414806,
      "version": 1374,
      "versionNonce": 1182622102,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784876784447,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design Dropbox/Google Drive\n\n\nDropbox is a cloud-based file storage service that allos users to store and share files.\nIt provides a secure and reliable way to store and access files from anywhere on any device\n\n\nFunctional requirements : \n\n- upload a file \n- download file \n- automatically sync files across devices\n\nOut of scope :\n\n- roll own blob storage \n\n\nNon-functional requirements :\n\n- availability >> consistency \n- low latency uploads and downloads (as low as possible)\n- support large files as 50 gb\n    - resumable uploads \n- high data integrity (sync accuracy)\n\n\nEntities \n \n- File (raw bytes)\n- File Metadata\n- Users \n\nAPI \n\nPOST /files -> 200\nbody: File & FileMetadata\n\nGET /files/:fileId -> File & FileMetaData\n\nGET /changes?since={timestamp} -> FileMetaData[]\n\n Updated APIs :- \n\nPOST /files -> presigned url \nbody: FileMetaData\n\nPUT {presignedUrl}\nbody: FileChunk\n\n\nPATCH  /files->200\nbody: Partial<FileMetaData> (chunk status updates)\n\nGET /files/:fileId -> File & FileMetaData\n\nGET /changes?since={timestamp} -> FileMetaData[]  \n   ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design Dropbox/Google Drive\n\n\nDropbox is a cloud-based file storage service that allos users to store and share files.\nIt provides a secure and reliable way to store and access files from anywhere on any device\n\n\nFunctional requirements : \n\n- upload a file \n- download file \n- automatically sync files across devices\n\nOut of scope :\n\n- roll own blob storage \n\n\nNon-functional requirements :\n\n- availability >> consistency \n- low latency uploads and downloads (as low as possible)\n- support large files as 50 gb\n    - resumable uploads \n- high data integrity (sync accuracy)\n\n\nEntities \n \n- File (raw bytes)\n- File Metadata\n- Users \n\nAPI \n\nPOST /files -> 200\nbody: File & FileMetadata\n\nGET /files/:fileId -> File & FileMetaData\n\nGET /changes?since={timestamp} -> FileMetaData[]\n\n Updated APIs :- \n\nPOST /files -> presigned url \nbody: FileMetaData\n\nPUT {presignedUrl}\nbody: FileChunk\n\n\nPATCH  /files->200\nbody: Partial<FileMetaData> (chunk status updates)\n\nGET /files/:fileId -> File & FileMetaData\n\nGET /changes?since={timestamp} -> FileMetaData[]  \n   ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
