      "text": "LB & Api\nGateway\n\n- authentication\n- rate limiting\n- SSL\n- Routing\n\n- upload(file,\nfileMetaData)\n- getFile(fileId)\n\nFile Service\n\nBlob storage\n\n(s3)\n\nupload file\n\nwrite metadata\n\nFile MetaData\n\nFile Metadata\n\n- FileId\n- File Name\n- Mime Type\n- size\n- OwnerId\n- s3Link\n- Creation Timestamp\n- Update Timestamp\n- ... metadata\n\nStoring the raw bytes of the files\n\nDownload Directly from S3\n\nClient \nApp\n\nLocal Folder\n\nSync service\n\ngetChanges()\n\nLocal DB",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LB & Api\nGateway\n\n- authentication\n- rate limiting\n- SSL\n- Routing\n\n- upload(file,\nfileMetaData)\n- getFile(fileId)\n\nFile Service\n\nBlob storage\n\n(s3)\n\nupload file\n\nwrite metadata\n\nFile MetaData\n\nFile Metadata\n\n- FileId\n- File Name\n- Mime Type\n- size\n- OwnerId\n- s3Link\n- Creation Timestamp\n- Update Timestamp\n- ... metadata\n\nStoring the raw bytes of the files\n\nDownload Directly from S3\n\nClient \nApp\n\nLocal Folder\n\nSync service\n\ngetChanges()\n\nLocal DB",
